.Sh DESCRIPTION
Uplift is a pure add-on package for
.Em oMLX :
it never modifies vanilla omlx files in place (patches are the explicit
exception, see
.Sx PATCHES ) .
The classic dashboard at
.Pa /admin/
stays byte-identical; Uplift serves its own UI at
.Pa /uplift/ .
.Pp
Uplift mounts itself into omlx's python with exactly ONE file: a
.Pa .pth
drop-in that bootstraps
.Va sys.path
to Uplift's own venv and imports the autopatch hook.
The omlx keg never holds package copies and its own files are never edited,
so
.Ic brew
upgrade omlx
stays byte-clean.
